  m_Text: Welcome to the Infochemistry Scientific Centre located at the ITMO orbital
    station. You will carry out a lab that is devoted to the formation of ordered
    patterns from hydroxyapatite. The Liesegang rings are self-assembled structures
    made from insoluble compounds via its periodic precipitation in gel media.
